v 0.1.0
d 'WBOPENDATA': module to access World Bank Open Data API (parallel-track distribution)
d 
d wbopendata allows Stata users to download indicators from the World Bank
d Open Data API. This distribution (wb-api-repo, v0.x track) provides the
d historical wbopendata Stata command surface (v17.0 lineage) alongside a
d Python CLI for batch metadata and time-series retrieval.
d 
d Feature parity with wbopendata-dev (v18.x track) is being phased in;
d see CHANGELOG.md and doc/VERSIONING_POLICY.md for the alignment plan.
d 
d KW: World Bank
d KW: development indicators
d KW: WDI
d KW: API
d KW: open data
d 
d Requires: Stata version 14
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20260522
d License: MIT
d 
d Author: João Pedro Azevedo
d Repository: https://github.com/jpazvd/wb-api-repo
d 
